      "id": "e3",
      "prompt": "Supplier contract v2 replaces clause 7: a fetched price is guaranteed for 600 seconds. Give QuoteService(supplier, *, clock=time.monotonic) an optional clock that returns seconds. A price fetched at time t may be reused by quote and quote_many calls made while clock() - t < 600, and must be fetched again after that. The supplier also grants a 5% volume discount: a line of 10 or more units costs 5% less.",
      "clarifications": {
        "scope": "Use Python standard library only. Preserve existing public APIs unless this episode explicitly extends them. No network, threads, or concurrent callers are required. Add or update visible tests as needed.",
